cmark: cmark (CommonMark parsing/rendering library)
cmark:
cmark: cmark is the C reference implementation of CommonMark, a rationalized
cmark: version of Markdown syntax with a spec. It provides a shared library
cmark: (libcmark) with functions for parsing CommonMark documents to an
cmark: abstract syntax tree (AST). It also provides a command-line program
cmark: (cmark) for parsing and rendering CommonMark documents.
